    "source": "analytic",
    "note": "As modify2_pattern_adjust_to_slope, but Identical: the copies are the first hole's cut moved 40 and 80 mm along X (each a cylinder of r 3 under a slanted top at its centre height 35/3), so the copies stop below the slope (blind holes with a slanted end face). Removed = 3*pi*9*35/3 = 315 pi; V = 18000 - 315 pi. Faces: 6 + 3 walls + 2 slanted end faces = 11."
